 * @param {number} record_id - ID of the current record
 */
async function category(select_element, de, record_id)
```

## 🌐 Server API Endpoints

- **List**: `accion=list&de=color` → Returns `{data: [{categoria_id, categoria}, ...]}`
- **Add**: `accion=add&de=color&categoria=Red` → Returns `{categoria_id: 123}`
- **Edit**: `accion=edit&de=color&categoria_id=123&categoria=Dark Red` → Returns success on error the message to show the user
- **Delete**: `accion=delete&categoria_id=123&de=color` → Returns success on error the message to show the user

